  "summary": "组件外optionsbuilder裸调全局Builder缺组件构建层，当前官方this内部Builder约束和ComponentContent12+路径支持修复：合法封装+UIContext内容对象直接open，同content close、消失/失败一次dispose；或各组件内部thisBuilder打开。静态过需补运行入口/PID观察。",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "模板组件内this Builder被改模块helper全局直接调",
      "kind": "case",
      "assessment": "supported",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "case-256a1816e74ef8a6f70d",
          "quote": "这个闭包不属于任何组件实例，却直接创建@ComponentV2的TextAssetFragment，偏离了模板中由this调用组件内builder的结构。"
        }
      ],
      "note": "不说全局Builder本身不可用，问题在optionsbuilder普通helper直接调。",
      "graph_node": "C_context"
    },
    {
      "text": "契约与编译过仍点击崩",
      "kind": "case",
      "assessment": "supported",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "case-256a1816e74ef8a6f70d",
          "quote": "随后契约测试与HAP编译均通过"
        }
      ],
      "note": "PID不变只是未重启信号，仍要对话框真的显示/关闭与回填语义另验。",
      "graph_node": "C_static"
    },
    {
      "text": "wrapBuilder ComponentContent修开关与dispose",
      "kind": "case",
      "assessment": "supported",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "case-256a1816e74ef8a6f70d",
          "quote": "修复改为wrapBuilder(textAssetDialogContent)加new ComponentContent(uiContext, …)，再交给openCustomDialog(content, options)；\n关闭改用closeCustomDialog(content)，并在关闭、onDidDisappear及打开失败时dispose。"
        }
      ],
      "note": "具体释放须避免重复dispose/关闭动画未结束即销毁；原how只onDidDisappear和失败更清晰。",
      "graph_node": "C_fix"
    },
    {
      "text": "组件外用wrapBuilder+ComponentContent开关释放",
      "kind": "case",
      "assessment": "supported",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "case-256a1816e74ef8a6f70d",
          "quote": "从组件外的共享函数打开自定义弹窗时，不要在options.builder闭包里直接调用全局@Builder。改用wrapBuilder(全局Builder)加new ComponentContent(uiContext, wrapped, 参数)，以openCustomDialog(content, options)打开、closeCustomDialog(content)关闭，并在onDidDisappear与打开失败分支调用dispose。"
        }
      ],
      "note": "不是所有运行正确性都用PID证明，仍需真实显示关闭。",
      "graph_node": "R_content"
    },
    {
      "text": "optionsbuilder保组件内this",
      "kind": "case",
      "assessment": "supported",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "case-256a1816e74ef8a6f70d",
          "quote": "若要沿用options.builder写法，就把@Builder放在发起弹窗的@ComponentV2内，按builder: () => { this.xxx() }调用，由各入口组件自行打开。参考模板里的this绑定是必要条件，抽成共享helper时不能省掉。"
        }
      ],
      "note": "不是所有运行正确性都用PID证明，仍需真实显示关闭。",
      "graph_node": "R_internal"
    },
    {
      "text": "真机点入口/PID，非只编译",
      "kind": "case",
      "assessment": "supported",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "case-256a1816e74ef8a6f70d",
          "quote": "改动弹窗的打开方式后，契约测试和编译通过并不能说明构建上下文正确；应在真机上点击入口，并核对点击前后进程PID未变。"
        }
      ],
      "note": "不是所有运行正确性都用PID证明，仍需真实显示关闭。",
      "graph_node": "R_runtime"
    },
    {
      "text": "CustomDialogOptions要求箭头this内部builder",
      "kind": "axiom",
      "assessment": "supported",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "dd5ccce492b7fd98d54e9389",
          "quote": "|builder|[CustomBuilder](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-references/ts-types#custombuilder8)|否|否|设置自定义弹窗的内容。 **说明：** builder需要赋值为箭头函数，格式如下：() => { this.XXX() }，其中XXX是内部builder名。 全局builder需要在组件内部创建，并在内部builder中调用。"
        }
      ],
      "note": "该限定是optionsbuilder路径，不限制合法ComponentContent的globalBuilder封装。",
      "graph_node": "A_internal"
    },
    {
      "text": "wrapBuilder返回封装全局Builder可传对象",
      "kind": "axiom",
      "assessment": "supported",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "429abe622e3142ff3d6e116f",
          "quote": "为了解决这一问题，引入wrapBuilder作为全局@Builder封装函数。wrapBuilder返回WrappedBuilder对象，用于[全局@Builder](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/arkts-builder#全局自定义构建函数)的赋值和传递。"
        }
      ],
      "note": "Wrap非任意普通函数变UI，源必须合法Builder且参数形状匹配。",
      "graph_node": "A_wrap"
    },
    {
      "text": "ComponentContent12构造UIContext及单参数WrappedBuilder",
